# Valinor: your own models and textures (for example from BFME2) stay on your computer only.
# They're never committed, so they never reach GitHub or the public site.
valinor/models/*
!valinor/models/README.md
valinor/textures/*
!valinor/textures/README.md
valinor/sabers/*
!valinor/sabers/README.md
valinor/levels/*
!valinor/levels/README.md
